{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2022-11-01 19:35:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF PFIZER INC. - PFE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - NOVEMBER 1, 2022) - POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF PFIZER INC. ("PFIZER" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: PFE). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S. WILLOUGHBY AT NEWACTION@POMLAW.COM OR 888-476-6529, EXT. 7980.THE INVESTIGATION CONCERNS WHETHER PFIZER AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS AND/OR DIRECTORS HAVE ENGAGED IN SECURITIES FRAUD OR OTHER UNLAWFUL BUSINESS PRACTICES.'}{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2022-11-01 06:30:00', 'title': 'PFIZER ANNOUNCES POSITIVE TOP-LINE DATA OF PHASE 3 GLOBAL MATERNAL IMMUNIZATION TRIAL FOR ITS BIVALENT RESPIRATORY SYNCYTIAL VIRUS (RSV) VACCINE CANDIDATE', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PFIZER INC. (NYSE: PFE) TODAY ANNOUNCED POSITIVE TOP-LINE DATA FROM THE PHASE 3 CLINICAL TRIAL (NCT04424316) MATISSE (MATERNAL IMMUNIZATION STUDY FOR SAFETY AND EFFICACY) INVESTIGATING ITS BIVALENT RSV PREFUSION VACCINE CANDIDATE, RSVPREF OR PF-06928316, WHEN ADMINISTERED TO PREGNANT PARTICIPANTS TO HELP PROTECT THEIR INFANTS FROM RSV DISEASE AFTER BIRTH.'}